Modifications in this copy (DannySotzny/skills):
- Added scripts/dtrack-setup.sh (stand-alone interactive setup replacing the
  upstream repository-wide setup.sh) and updated references to it.
- Moved the test suite to tests/test-dependency-track.sh inside the skill and
  added a check for dtrack-setup.sh.
- Updated README.md (install source, complete script table, setup, tests).
- Security hardening: dtrack-api.sh no longer follows redirects, accepts only an
  API path plus a JSON body (no arbitrary curl arguments), and passes the API
  key via a temporary header file; _config.sh validates the server URL and
  warns on plain HTTP; new scripts/_lib.sh validates UUIDs, enums and page
  numbers and URL-encodes free text; dtrack-findings.sh passes filters to jq
  as --arg; dtrack-bom-upload.sh only uploads CycloneDX/SPDX files and builds
  the payload in temp files.
- dtrack-setup.sh gained --status, --url and --key for agent-guided setup.
- SKILL.md: first-use flow and safety rules (confirm writes, treat API data as
  untrusted, never handle the key in chat).
- Packaged as a Claude Code plugin via .claude-plugin/marketplace.json.
